{"seq":1,"slug":"heat-treatment-fumigation-parameters","title":"热处理与溴甲烷熏蒸的处理工艺与参数模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/wood-packaging-treatment-marking-data/heat-treatment-fumigation-parameters","wordCount":2900,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"热处理与溴甲烷熏蒸的处理工艺与参数模型\">热处理与溴甲烷熏蒸的处理工艺与参数模型</h1><p>木质包装（托盘、垫木、板条箱）一旦被判定为 ISPM 15 管辖对象，处理环节就只有一个工程问题：用可记录、可复现、可审计的物理过程，把木材内部的活体有害生物灭活到标准认可的程度。ISPM 15 不规定&quot;设备型号&quot;，只规定&quot;达标判定&quot;，因此真正需要被精确建模的不是机器，而是<strong>处理剂量（treatment schedule）</strong>——一组关键控制参数与一个达标阈值。本文拆解两种最主流的获批处理（热处理与溴甲烷熏蒸）的参数结构、物理机理，以及把参数转化为可审计处理记录的数据模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-获批处理清单与-处理剂量-三元组\">核心概念：获批处理清单与「处理剂量」三元组</h2><p>ISPM 15 源于联合国粮农组织（FAO）下属国际植物保护公约（IPPC）秘书处发布的第 15 号国际植物检疫措施标准《国际贸易中木质包装材料管理准则》，2002 年通过，附件 1 是<strong>获批处理清单</strong>：早期仅热处理（HT）与溴甲烷熏蒸（MB），2017 年修订版新增介电加热（DH），此后又陆续讨论化学加压浸渍（CPI）等处理。任何未列入附件 1 的工艺（例如简单烘干、喷涂、太阳能暴晒）都不构成合规处理，即便它&quot;杀死了虫子&quot;。</p>\n<p>每一种获批处理都可以抽象成同一结构：<strong>方法 + 关键控制参数 + 达标判定</strong>。方法决定测什么物理量；关键控制参数是必须被持续记录、且必须落在标准区间内的量（温度、时长、剂量、浓度）；达标判定则是把记录换算成&quot;合格/不合格&quot;的规则。这套三元组是后面所有内容的主线——处理记录系统本质上就是在为这三个槽位建模，并把它们绑定到一个唯一的包装件标识上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[木质包装件 WC] --&gt; B{选择获批处理}&#10;  B --&gt;|导热加热| C[热处理 HT&lt;br/&gt;木材核心 ≥56°C 持续 ≥30min]&#10;  B --&gt;|介电加热| D[介电加热 DH&lt;br/&gt;木材核心 ≥60°C 持续 ≥1min]&#10;  B --&gt;|化学熏蒸| E[溴甲烷 MB&lt;br/&gt;按温度带定剂量 + 保持 24h]&#10;  C --&gt; F[核心温度连续记录]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[浓度序列 + CT 判定]&#10;  F --&gt; H[处理记录存档]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[加施 IPPC 标识 + 出证]\">flowchart TD\n  A[木质包装件 WC] --&gt; B{选择获批处理}\n  B --&gt;|导热加热| C[热处理 HT&lt;br/&gt;木材核心 ≥56°C 持续 ≥30min]\n  B --&gt;|介电加热| D[介电加热 DH&lt;br/&gt;木材核心 ≥60°C 持续 ≥1min]\n  B --&gt;|化学熏蒸| E[溴甲烷 MB&lt;br/&gt;按温度带定剂量 + 保持 24h]\n  C --&gt; F[核心温度连续记录]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[浓度序列 + CT 判定]\n  F --&gt; H[处理记录存档]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[加施 IPPC 标识 + 出证]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>热处理 HT</th>\n<th>介电加热 DH</th>\n<th>溴甲烷熏蒸 MB</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关键物理量</td>\n<td>木材<strong>核心</strong>温度</td>\n<td>木材<strong>核心</strong>温度</td>\n<td>熏蒸空间<strong>浓度</strong> × 时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>达标阈值</td>\n<td>≥56°C，连续 ≥30 min</td>\n<td>≥60°C，连续 ≥1 min</td>\n<td>按温度带剂量，保持 24 h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度下限约束</td>\n<td>无（加热即达标）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（低于约 10°C 药效不成立）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记录形态</td>\n<td>温度时间序列</td>\n<td>温度时间序列</td>\n<td>剂量 + 多点浓度读数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要外部约束</td>\n<td>窑容量、能耗</td>\n<td>设备成本</td>\n<td>蒙特利尔议定书受控物质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>残留/影响</td>\n<td>无化学残留</td>\n<td>无化学残留</td>\n<td>有残留，部分国家限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种方法在记录形态上的差异（连续温度曲线 vs 离散浓度读数）直接决定了后文数据模型的字段设计。对处理与加施标识之间的衔接，见同章 <a href=\"./\">处理、加施标识与数据凭证工程</a> 的章节说明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热处理-ht-的参数模型-核心温度与热传导\">热处理（HT）的参数模型：核心温度与热传导</h2><p>热处理唯一被标准认可的量是<strong>木材核心温度</strong>，而不是窑内空气温度。ISPM 15 附件 1 对 HT 的规定是：木材中心温度在<strong>整个厚度剖面</strong>达到 <strong>56°C 并连续保持至少 30 分钟</strong>。这意味着测点必须布置在最难升温的位置——最厚件的心部或堆垛的冷点，而不是窑内回风处或木料表面。空气中的温度再高，只要心部未达 56°C，处理即不合格。</p>\n<p>为什么是 30 分钟而不是瞬时达标？因为生物灭活是温度与时间的联合函数：害虫在 56°C 下需要一定累积暴露才能被杀死，短时高温不足以穿透其耐热结构。工程上因此把&quot;心部达温&quot;与&quot;持续时长&quot;分开建模，后者依赖前者。</p>\n<p>热传导决定了处理时间的量级。一维热扩散由傅里叶方程描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial t} = \\alpha \\nabla^2 T, \\qquad \\alpha = \\frac{k}{\\rho c_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是热扩散率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 导热系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 密度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比热容。对厚度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的板材，心部达到外界温度某一比例所需的特征时间近似满足傅里叶数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Fo</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 为常数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>o</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Fo = \\frac{\\alpha t}{L^2} \\Rightarrow t \\propto \\frac{L^2}{\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9781em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\propto L^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的关系是窑干排程的物理根据：厚度加倍，达温时间约变为四倍。它与密度负相关（密度越大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 越小、越慢），因此同一窑次里混装不同树种与厚度时，排程必须按<strong>最慢件</strong>（最厚 + 最密）计算。实操要点包括：垛内留出均匀风道（stickers 间隔）、控制干球/湿球温度曲线避免表裂与内裂、以及在心部达温后仍维持足够余量再停机，避免&quot;外热内冷&quot;的假达标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"溴甲烷熏蒸-mb-的参数模型-剂量-温度带与-ct\">溴甲烷熏蒸（MB）的参数模型：剂量、温度带与 CT</h2><p>溴甲烷（methyl bromide, MB）是常温气体熏蒸，其灭活条件是<strong>暴露腔内达到足够的气相浓度并维持足够时间</strong>。与热处理不同，MB 的达标判定不是单点温度阈值，而是浓度随时间的累积。标准以<strong>剂量—温度带—时长</strong>的组合给出排程：温度越低，维持同样药效所需的初始剂量越高，因为低温下熏蒸剂穿透与昆虫代谢均变慢。ISPM 15 附件 1 常见的引用剂量表如下（实施时以标准现行版本与各国植物保护组织 NPPO 的国内名录为准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>温度带</th>\n<th>初始剂量</th>\n<th>保持时长</th>\n<th>判定方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≥ 21 °C</td>\n<td>48 g/m³</td>\n<td>24 h</td>\n<td>规定时点浓度读数不低于阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 – 20.9 °C</td>\n<td>64 g/m³</td>\n<td>24 h</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 – 9.9 °C</td>\n<td>80 g/m³</td>\n<td>24 h</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>排程的核心不是初始投药量，而是<strong>浓度—时间乘积 CT</strong>。熏蒸箱会泄漏、木材会吸附（sorption），浓度随时间衰减，因此标准要求在投药后若干固定时点（例如 0.5 h、2 h、4 h、24 h）读取浓度，确认浓度未跌破阈值。连续形式下：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CT</mtext><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>end</mtext></msub></msubsup><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>g</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>h</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CT} = \\int_{0}^{t_{\\text{end}}} c(\\tau)\\, d\\tau \\quad [\\text{g}\\cdot\\text{h}/\\text{m}^3]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4554em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5435em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">end</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>离散采样时用梯形近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CT</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CT} \\approx \\sum_i \\frac{c_i + c_{i+1}}{2}(t_{i+1}-t_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2051em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8601em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4518em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2025em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。参数模型必须同时守住三件事：<strong>箱体气密性</strong>（泄漏使浓度曲线整体下移）、<strong>货物装载率</strong>（木材是强吸附体，装载过密会显著吃掉气相浓度）、<strong>环境温度</strong>（低于约 10°C 时药效不成立，需升温或改用热处理）。任一项失控都会表现为&quot;后期浓度不足&quot;，属于典型的不合格模式。</p>\n<p>MB 还有一层非技术约束：它是《蒙特利尔议定书》受控的消耗臭氧层物质。欧盟依据 ODS 法规（EC）No 1005/2009 对检疫与装运前用途设有豁免但严格管控，中国相关部门亦发布受控消耗臭氧层物质清单进行管理。这使 MB 的成本与可获得性随法规收紧而波动，出口商越来越多地把它作为 HT 之后的备选，而非首选。相关制度边界见同 hub <a href=\"../phytosanitary-regime-legal-model/\">植物检疫制度与 ISPM-15 法律模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数偏差-失效模式与再处理判定\">参数偏差、失效模式与再处理判定</h2><p>真实产线上，参数模型的价值在于把&quot;合格/不合格&quot;变成对记录曲线的自动判定。HT 最常见的失效是<strong>测温点错位</strong>：探头置于木料表层或垛间空气，导致曲线漂亮但心部未达 56°C；其次是<strong>传感器未校准</strong>，读数系统性偏高几度。DH 因靠高频电场由内向外加热，失效模式偏向局部过热或功率不足导致心部未达 60°C。MB 的失效则集中在浓度端：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效模式</th>\n<th>触发原因</th>\n<th>记录上的表现</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HT 心部未达温</td>\n<td>测点错位、混装过厚</td>\n<td>温度曲线平缓不达标</td>\n<td>重新处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HT 时长不足</td>\n<td>提前停机</td>\n<td>达温后持续 &lt; 30 min</td>\n<td>重新处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MB 后期浓度不足</td>\n<td>泄漏、吸附、装载过密</td>\n<td>末次读数跌破阈值</td>\n<td>重新处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MB 全箱药效不成立</td>\n<td>环境温度低于工作下限</td>\n<td>首末浓度普遍偏低</td>\n<td>升温后重熏或改 HT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记录不完整</td>\n<td>记录仪故障、人工补录</td>\n<td>时间序列断点</td>\n<td>不可判定，按不合格处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于**&quot;不可判定&quot;必须与&quot;不合格&quot;分开**：记录断点、缺读数、单位错误属于证据不足，与明确超标在合规后果上不同（前者需返工补证，后者直接触发再处理）。判定引擎应把两者映射为不同状态机分支，而不是一律判 fail。查明拦截后的口岸处置流程，见同 hub <a href=\"../customs-inspection-interception-response/\">口岸查验、拦截处置与退运响应流程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处理记录的数据模型-从参数到可审计凭证\">处理记录的数据模型：从参数到可审计凭证</h2><p>处理记录（treatment record）是把上述参数固化为凭证的载体，也是 IPPC 标识与植物检疫证书的数据来源。它的最小可用模型包含四组字段：<strong>标识</strong>（包装件/批次 ID、处理机构执照号）、<strong>参数</strong>（随方法而异的量）、<strong>判定</strong>（规则版本 + 结论）、<strong>出处</strong>（实施的 NPPO、设备、操作员、时间戳）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段组</th>\n<th>HT / DH 字段</th>\n<th>MB 字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方法与阈值</td>\n<td>method, 阈值温度, 最短时长</td>\n<td>method, 温度带, 初始剂量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观测流</td>\n<td>温度时间序列（测点位置）</td>\n<td>浓度读数序列（时点、箱体 ID）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派生量</td>\n<td>心部达温时刻、持续时长</td>\n<td>CT 积分值、末次浓度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定</td>\n<td>规则版本、结论、判定人</td>\n<td>规则版本、结论、判定人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出处</td>\n<td>处理地点、执照号、设备 ID、操作员</td>\n<td>处理地点、执照号、熏蒸箱 ID、操作员</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模型设计上有两个易错点。其一，<strong>阈值必须与标准版本绑定</strong>：ISPM 15 修订会调整表值，若记录只存&quot;合格&quot;布尔值而不存当时适用的规则版本，多年后审计将无法复算。其二，<strong>观测流与派生量要分开存</strong>：原始温度/浓度序列是证据，CT 与持续时长是可重算的派生物，一旦前者丢失，后者就失去了可验证性。处理记录随后驱动加施标识（IPPC 章）与出证，其编码与凭证链在下一节展开，见同章 <a href=\"./\">处理、加施标识与数据凭证工程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ISPM 15 附件 1 定义获批处理清单；所有处理抽象为<strong>方法 + 关键控制参数 + 达标判定</strong>三元组。</li>\n<li>热处理（HT）以木材<strong>核心温度 ≥56°C 连续 ≥30 分钟</strong>判定，达温时间近似服从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\propto L^2/\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，排程按最慢件（最厚最密）计算。</li>\n<li>介电加热（DH）由内向外加热，阈值为核心 <strong>≥60°C 持续 ≥1 分钟</strong>。</li>\n<li>溴甲烷熏蒸（MB）按<strong>剂量—温度带—时长</strong>排程，判定基于浓度序列的 CT 积分与末次浓度；温度低于工作下限时药效不成立，且该物质受蒙特利尔议定书管控。</li>\n<li>参数偏差主要表现为测温点错位、时长不足、浓度不足三类失效；判定引擎必须把&quot;不可判定&quot;与&quot;不合格&quot;分开建模。</li>\n<li>处理记录数据模型须存<strong>原始观测流、派生判定、以及判定所依据的规则版本</strong>，才能经得起事后审计并驱动 IPPC 标识与出证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热处理与溴甲烷熏蒸的处理工艺与参数模型","id":"热处理与溴甲烷熏蒸的处理工艺与参数模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：获批处理清单与「处理剂量」三元组","id":"核心概念-获批处理清单与-处理剂量-三元组"},{"level":2,"text":"热处理（HT）的参数模型：核心温度与热传导","id":"热处理-ht-的参数模型-核心温度与热传导"},{"level":2,"text":"溴甲烷熏蒸（MB）的参数模型：剂量、温度带与 CT","id":"溴甲烷熏蒸-mb-的参数模型-剂量-温度带与-ct"},{"level":2,"text":"参数偏差、失效模式与再处理判定","id":"参数偏差-失效模式与再处理判定"},{"level":2,"text":"处理记录的数据模型：从参数到可审计凭证","id":"处理记录的数据模型-从参数到可审计凭证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"违规责任归属、处罚后果与合规义务分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/phytosanitary-regime-legal-model/violation-liability-compliance-obligation"},"next":{"title":"IPPC 加施标识规则与打标追溯数据工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/wood-packaging-treatment-marking-data/ippc-marking-traceability-data"}}